H9 sqlite_amxx.dll -- AMX Mod X's SQLite module, built from source for 128 player slots
=======================================================================================

What this is
------------

ts\addons\amxmodx\modules\sqlite_amxx.dll is AMX Mod X's SQLite module,
built by H9 from TSM\AMXMODX: goldsrc-net/amxmodx (the AMX Mod X fork reTS ships with),
branch 64bit at commit dedff660dff3fa615a96d6ba3890d6000b588ed1,
with H9's changes as uncommitted working-tree changes (AMXMODX\H9-SOURCE.txt).
The core and every module H9 ships but three are built together from that one tree, for
128 player slots: tsx_amxx.dll stays reTSX (docs\PLAYER_LIMIT_128.txt, section 8.5),
easy_http_amxx.dll is a third-party module, and mysql_amxx.dll (it links MySQL's C
connector, and no H9 plugin loads it) stays the release's.

H9's changes in it: none. It is built unchanged from the same tree, so it matches the core
it loads in; nothing in it is sized by the player count.

