Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The sqlite_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
861696 bytes, SHA256 689FB4FDA3B2EC8AB3CA5434B4DA19AEA180D2AF377978C8BD702A849EEFE3BD,
kept as sqlite_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over sqlite_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
